 physical contaminants that are more than 20 times smaller than jug filters. Combined with our higher filtration contact time we are 20 times more powerful than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.<div><br><div>Our stainless steel chambers not only prevent microplastics and other harmful chemicals from leaching into your water, but also hold significantly more purified water than the average jug. This makes it even easier for you to enjoy fresh, nutrient-rich hydration - whenever you need it most. Unlike Reverse Osmosis (RO) filters, the gravity system does not require electricity to run or a plumber to install - and it won’t strip your water of the healthy nutrients your body benefits from.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-fdu249qq9vc" data-id="ecom-fdu249qq9vc" style="z-index: inherit;"><div class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--first core__column--last ecom-gv4z017lz2t"><div class="core__column--wrapper" id="ecom-gv4z017lz2t"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-gl4ty8airwb"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-fdu249qq9vc"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">{{ 'sections.ecom-stainless-steel-water-filter-product.headingtext_gl4ty8airwb_html' | t }}</h3></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-pgft6pmm42" data-id="ecom-pgft6pmm42" style="z-index: inherit;"><div class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--firs