 "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "Product description:",
 "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for \nany countertop in your home or workplace, no \nplumber or electricity required.<\/li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally \nBPA-free and non-leaching.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Activated carbon filters made out from the \nhighest grade coconut shells (CTC 60) and infused \nwith silver to remove 99.99% contaminants and \npreserve the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the \nmost effective, sustainable and durable filtration on \nthe market.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "view_more_text_r79fzbgcs7_html": "View more",
 "view_less_text_r79fzbgcs7_html": "View less",
 "headingtext_oz8n4z82l8p_html": "Designed for durability",
 "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity\u2019s 304 \nstainless steel housing won\u2019t leach polyurethane, \nmicroplastics or harmful chemicals into your \nwater over time.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of \neveryday use for 10+ years<\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_a3edtfaji5j_html": " <ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter \nwater for all your drinking and cooking needs<\/li><li>Designed for longevity- our cartridges last up to 12 months. This means fewer replacements and \nlower cost per litre<\/li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria \nre-growth- one of the most common problems \nwith traditional filters<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "headingtext_e2cv63xjt4k_html": "How our technology works",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomwx6prxol82a_wx6prxol82a_html": "Fresh, nutrient-rich water funnels from streams into public water systems.",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomxowb6xmhsr_xowb6xmhsr_html": "It\u2019s exposed to contaminants including heavy metals, parasites, chemical waste, pesticides + more.",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomcm3ogc2unm5_cm3ogc2unm5_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Filter purifies tap water through activated carbon cartridges made from the highest quality coconut shells",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom6q6mr9xl4xv_6q6mr9xl4xv_html": "The dense, porous wall removes 99.99% of contaminants - without altering your water\u2019s oxygen or mineral content.",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomcqij76ged76_cqij76ged76_html": "You and your loved ones enjoy fresh, nutrient-rich water with ease - just as nature intended",
 "headingtext_037i333bcuod_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
 "buttoncontent_awcs2j2f8h_html": "Complete Purchase",
 "headingtext_j5rk9bbw2l_html": "Filtration At Its Finest",
 "title0_7bivs8fk8r5_html": "Removes 99.9% <br>of contaminants",
 "title0_hy0bfeafq_html": "Highest-grade <br> stainless steel",
 "title0_j4et0rugxvl_html": "Natural activated <br>carbon filtration",
 "title0_yog81uuo1j_html": "Planet-friendly <br> purification",
 "title0_y2i0bvbvijq_html": "Fresh taste you <br> can trust",
 "title0_8kxeenei6u3_html": "10-year warranty, 100-day <br>money back guarantee",
 "headingtext_ej9r82f3z6w_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
 "textcontent_tluznympyp_html": "Designed and manufactured in-house. Advanced and sustainable drinking water filtration removing 99.99% contaminants whilst retaining 100% nutrients.",
 "headingtext_n1ujbm1emyd_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
 "buttoncontent_bllo9g07igw_html": "Complete Purchase",
 "headingtext_yfjfj90hyol_html": "Go one step further for \nfluoride removal:",
 "textcontent_aea6pxjqpdj_html": "<ul><li>Our additional POSTreat filter removes more than \n95% of fluoride for highly targeted filtration<\/li><li>Works in tandem with Phoenix Gravity Filters made of \n304 grade stainless steel<\/li><li>Designed for maximum reuse, the first on the market \nwith refillable environmentally-friendly materials<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "buttoncontent_ss2uq2gd6y_html": "Shop now",
 "headingtext_57xat3dr82r_html": "Contaminants removed",
 "name0_87uyitbmi1_html": "microplastics",
 "name1_87uyitbmi1_html": "heavy metals",
 "name2_87uyitbmi1_html": "PFAs",
 "name3_87uyitbmi1_html": "pesticides",
 "name4_87uyitbmi1_html": "giardia cysts",
 "name5_87uyitbmi1_html": "Viruses",
 "name6_87uyitbmi1_html": "Bacteria",
 "name7_87uyitbmi1_html": "Parasites",
 "name8_87uyitbmi1_html": "Chlorine",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomak9phf1777d_ak9phf1777d_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter within 100 days, we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
 "buttoncontent_v1leabxas4d_html": "Refund Policy",
 "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "FAQs",
 "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Which size filter is best for me?",
 "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my filter?",
 "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
 "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
 "textcontent_fxwrc56lf3f_html": "This depends on how many people will be using your Phoenix Gravity Water Filter, and\nhow much water you drink! Generally, we recommend:<div>6-Litre - Perfect pairing, for up to 1-2 people<\/div><div>8-Litre - In the middle, for up to 2-4 people<\/div><div>12-Litre - Family friendly, for 3-4 + people<div><\/div><\/div>",
 "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "<b>Gravity Filter:<\/b> We recommend hand washing using warm soapy water and a\nnon-abrasive cloth or sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth.\n(Don\u2019t forget to remove your cartridges first!)<div><br><div><a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/1821\/9557\/files\/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a><\/div><div><b>Cartridges: <\/b>Wash these under cold running water only and using a mildly abrasive\nscourer or brush, gently massage along cartridges from mount to end only - to avoid\ncontamination.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>POSTreat: <\/b>Again, use warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth\/ sponge. Then, leave\nto air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don\u2019t forget to remove the media first!)<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/div>",
 "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Certainly! Our systems are designed to be extremely easy to assemble and everything\nyou need will be included. You can do it yourself with just your hands - there\u2019s no\nspecialist tools, plumbers or electricians required.<div><br><a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a><div>We include full instructions with every unit and we\u2019re always here to help. You can\ncontact us <a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.<\/font><\/a><br><\/div><\/div>",
 "headingtext_gl4ty8airwb_html": "Still have a burning question? See all our <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs <\/a>here.",
 "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
